Z||000000||batboy||01-28-2000||10:27 PM||||I added another page to my Batmobile website. This is Forum Fotos page 3 with seven more pics of Forum members' rides. I need more info about some of the pics. Take a look!<P> <A HREF="http://sites.netscape.net/batboybain/forumfoto3" TARGET=_blank>http://sites.netscape.net/batboybain/forumfoto3</A> <P><BR>Also I need more info about some of the pics on page 2 (see link below) especially the cool blue Fiero next to the sandcastle.<P> <A HREF="http://sites.netscape.net/batboybain/forumfoto2" TARGET=_blank>http://sites.netscape.net/batboybain/forumfoto2</A> <P><BR>Seems like I'm forgetting someone. Did anybody else send me a pic? I still have a little room, anyone else want their Fiero posted on my website? I might eventually have to go to thumbnails. I dunno.||||reg||6
Z||000001||87FieroGT||01-29-2000||01:10 AM||||Hey Batboy,<P>   That Cool Blue Fiero happens to belong to none other than me. Anyway it is an 87GT and my name is Jason. I am from the Rio Grande Valley in Texas and that picture was taken out on South Padre Island. If you need any other pics I will be glad to send them to you. Funny thing though is that the car will not be blue very much longer. I plan on repainting it. As to what color I will leave that a surprise and post pics when it is done. Talk to you later and thanks for putting my pic on your web page.<P>||||reg||6
Z||000002||Oreif||01-29-2000||01:33 AM||||Hey Batboy,<BR>Thanks for putting up my Fiero. What other info do you want? For starters The only paint on my car that IS NOT original is the scoop and the nose. Everything else is original. I have a massaged 2.8L V-6, Leather seats (just added 2 weeks ago) Sprint headers, and right now I'm replacing the entire suspension and brake system with all new parts. (urethane bushings, cross-drilled rotors, new everything, bigger front and rear sway bars, KYB shocks and struts, All suspension parts are being powder coated, and Carbon Kevlar/metallic brake pads!) Also yes the scoop is functional. I have a few more pic's with a front view of the car and a close-up of the scoop.<BR>Just let me know what else you need.<BR>Oreif||||reg||6
