Z||000004||Monkeyman||01-29-2000||09:05 AM||||I can't beleive you actually posted that snow pic.  Cool!  I like it.  If you have room for one more pic (in about a month or so) I'd like to send you one of my '85 GT.  It has custom paint if it makes any difference.  It doesn't look nearly as good as some of the other Fieros on your site, but it should still turn some heads.  (BTW--I should be getting it by the end of Feb at the latest, I hope!  Please, God.  Make the snow go away!)||||reg||1
